WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:17.532
Riley: Our pets are having fun.

2
00:00:17.533 --> 00:00:20.408
Chatter: Woo, woo!

3
00:00:20.409 --> 00:00:22.790
Kelli: What are you doing?

4
00:00:22.791 --> 00:00:28.001
Theo: We're giving our pets a ride.

5
00:00:28.002 --> 00:00:31.705
Skyler: Chatter loves the train.

6
00:00:31.706 --> 00:00:34.675
Theo: So does Frankie.

7
00:00:34.676 --> 00:00:37.988
Ben: I hope it's not too fast for Speedy.

8
00:00:37.989 --> 00:00:43.306
Theo: Uh-oh. Whiskers rolled off!

9
00:00:43.307 --> 00:00:44.575
Kelli: Mom went shopping.

10
00:00:44.576 --> 00:00:46.426
I'm babysitting you.

11
00:00:46.427 --> 00:00:49.096
Theo: We're not babies!

12
00:00:49.097 --> 00:00:54.156
Kelli: Whatever. I'm going outside to weed the garden.

13
00:00:54.157 --> 00:00:56.385
Kelli: Will you be okay in here?

14
00:00:56.386 --> 00:00:58.209
Theo: Yes!

15
00:00:58.210 --> 00:01:00.307
Kelli: Don't get into any trouble!

16
00:01:00.308 --> 00:01:02.112
Riley: We won't.

17
00:01:02.113 --> 00:01:07.059
Kelli: I'll be outside if you need anything.

18
00:01:07.060 --> 00:01:10.437
Ben: Let's pretend the train is going west.

19
00:01:10.438 --> 00:01:19.269
Riley: Next stop, Grand Canyon!

20
00:01:19.270 --> 00:01:24.087
Theo: Everyone, out!

21
00:01:24.088 --> 00:01:29.277
Ben: Speedy looks dizzy.

22
00:01:29.278 --> 00:01:32.085
Riley: Do turtles get dizzy?

23
00:01:32.086 --> 00:01:34.711
Sarah: Maybe the train was too fast.

24
00:01:34.712 --> 00:01:39.074
Skyler: Whiskers couldn't even hold on.

25
00:01:39.075 --> 00:01:45.197
Theo: Hey, where is Whiskers?

26
00:01:45.198 --> 00:01:47.316
Ben: I saw him a minute ago.

27
00:01:47.317 --> 00:01:49.071
Now he's gone.

28
00:01:49.072 --> 00:01:51.502
Skyler: Whiskers, where are you?

29
00:01:51.503 --> 00:01:54.686
Riley: I'll look behind the desk.

30
00:01:54.687 --> 00:01:59.476
Theo: I'll look under my bed.

31
00:01:59.477 --> 00:02:02.989
Sarah: It's dark under here.

32
00:02:02.990 --> 00:02:05.701
Skyler: We need a flashlight.

33
00:02:05.702 --> 00:02:14.201
Theo: Let's go ask my sister for one.

34
00:02:14.202 --> 00:02:18.653
Kelli! Do you have a flashlight?

35
00:02:18.654 --> 00:02:20.815
Kelli: There's one in the kitchen.

36
00:02:20.816 --> 00:02:22.840
What do you need it for?

37
00:02:22.841 --> 00:02:25.787
Sarah: We have to find Whiskers.

38
00:02:25.788 --> 00:02:33.013
Ben: Look! Whiskers is hanging from the roof!

39
00:02:33.014 --> 00:02:38.087
Kelli: Run upstairs and grab him, quick!

40
00:02:38.088 --> 00:02:44.193
Theo: I can't. The front door is locked!

41
00:02:44.194 --> 00:02:52.186
Kelli: And I don't have a key with me!
